message.content:
Robot vacuum cleaners with a self-contained electric motor fall under HTSUS 8508.11 (vacuum cleaners with self-contained electric motor, power not exceeding 1,500 W, with a bag or other receptacle capacity not exceeding 20 L). The 8508.11.00 subheading has statistical suffixes: 8508.11.0000 was the older form. After the 2022 changes, the structure is 8508.11.00 with 8508.11.0000 as the full code.

The product is a robot vacuum, and CBP rulings on robot vacuums often use 8508.11.0000. Dyson rulings for the wet/dry robot are likely also 8508.11.0000.

{"hts_code": "8508.11.0000", "reason": "A robotic wet/dry vacuum cleaner with a self-contained electric motor, rated under 1,500 W and with a dust receptacle under 20 L, is classified in heading 8508 as a vacuum cleaner, subheading 8508.11."}
